  "content": "<p>附魔描述旨在通过在被附魔的物品提示中添加效果描述来阐明附魔的作用。大多数模组附魔也受支持！本模组提供超过15种语言版本，包括西班牙语、中文、俄语和法语！它还支持所有主流模组加载器，包括<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions/files/all?gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a>。</p><p><img src=\"https://docs.darkhax.net/assets/enchantment-descriptions/enchanted_item.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><h2>依赖项</h2><p>本模组需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bookshelf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bookshelf</a>库。Fabric/Quilt玩家可能还希望安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tooltipfix\" rel=\"nofollow\">ToolTipFix</a>模组。该模组将修复一个原版bug，该bug会导致提示文本超出屏幕边缘。Forge和NeoForge已内置此修复。</p><h2>配置与自定义</h2><p>添加新描述或修改现有描述非常简单。还有许多配置选项可帮助您个性化模组。您可以在我们的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.darkhax.net%252fmods%252fenchantment-descriptions%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>上了解更多关于这些选项的信息。&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://assets.blamejared.com/nodecraft/darkhax.jpg\" alt=\"Nodecraft赞助标志\" width=\"1080\" height=\"40\">本项目由Nodecraft赞助。使用代码<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fdarkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">DARKHAX</a>可享受首月服务30%折扣！</p><p><img src=\"https://skulk.blmj.red/enchantment-descriptions\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p>",
